description: "Boot the installed FreeDOS disk and confirm a DOS prompt"
platform: dos
timeout: 2m

# Before running, disable the installer CD in the machine blueprint, make
# hdd the first boot device, and adopt the edit with reliquary apply.
wait "C:\>"
screenshot verified
enter "fdapm poweroff"
wait stopped
